der\">\\n      <h1>Federal Grant Opportunities Digest</h1>\\n      <p>7 opportunities &middot; September 04, 2026</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\"domain\">Arts, Law and Social Sciences</div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/8ea93672-b51b-4e0e-b079-d97848c1f800\">BJA FY 2026 Bridging Immigration-Related Deficits Experienced Nationwide Program: Joint Task Force Crossroads America - Indiana Invitation to Apply</a><div class=\"summary\">Supports costs for personnel, travel, training, and equipment to address law enforcement related to criminal illegal aliens in Indiana.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">Bureau of Justice Assistance</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2026-09-09</span><span class=\"tag award\">Up to $1,615,056</span></div></div><div class=\"domain\">Science, Technology, Engineering, Mathematics (STEM)</div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/9854b307-dff7-4f10-80dc-a760b9b3dbc2\">FY26 Atlantic Gateway, Arlington to Alexandria Fourth Track - CMAQ Funds</a><div class=\"summary\">Funds the construction of approximately six miles of new fourth track on the CSX Richmond, Fredericksburg, and Potomac Subdivision.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">DOT - Federal Railroad Administration</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2026-09-09</span><span class=\"tag award\">Up to $56,000,000</span></div></div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/9157af4e-c67b-4827-88a5-49149fa24a3d\">Request for Information - Gauging Investor Interest in the Development and Commercialization of Subsurface Energy Technologies</a><div class=\"summary\">Seeks to gauge investor interest in the development and commercialization of subsurface energy technologies.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">National Energy Technology Laboratory</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2026-10-05</span><span class=\"tag award\">Up to $2</span></div></div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/03297609-7453-4e82-8c53-ce31a0b42e28\">1890 Institution Teaching, Research, and Extension Capacity Building Grants Program</a><div class=\"summary\">Aims to build the teaching, research, and extension capacities of eligible 1890 institutions through cooperative programs.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">National Institute of Food and Agriculture</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2026-11-04</span><span class=\"tag award\">Up to $750,000</span></div></div><div class=\"domain\">Health Sciences</div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/f03c1c58-6492-460f-9f19-11ac14ec5184\">DoW Breast Cancer, Clinical Research Extension Award</a><div class=\"summary\">Supports research that extends data collection and analysis of breast cancer clinical studies.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">Defense Health Agency Contracting Activity - DHACA</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2026-11-18</span></div></div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/5fab0e14-d356-49f6-97dd-3054f0271cda\">DoW Breast Cancer, Breakthrough Award Levels 1 and 2</a><div class=\"summary\">Funds promising research with high potential to lead to breakthroughs in breast cancer.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">Defense Health Agency Contracting Activity - DHACA</span><span class=\"tag deadline\">Closes 2026-11-18</span></div></div><div class=\"card\"><a class=\"title\" href=\"https://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/be66c7b5-6a80-4b5f-98bf-b2424791e3f6\">Cancer Prevention and Control Programs for State, Territorial, and Tribal Organizations</a><div class=\"summary\">Supports the development and implementation of effective strategies for cancer prevention and control.</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"tag\">Centers for Disease Control - NCCDPHP</span